# NOTE: patterns must be **/-prefixed to match inside src/main/resources —
# root-anchored names only matched at the context root, where these files
# don't exist. Defense in depth only: the authoritative exclusion of dev
# resources from the release JAR is the `release-jar` Maven profile in pom.xml.
**/application-local.properties
**/application-dev.properties
**/application-e2e.properties
**/application-nitro.properties
